        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Tonal Harmony - Advanced",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "PROCESS:\n  1. Play in Key A: establish the home key\n  2. Introduce a PIVOT CHORD: a chord interpretable in both Key A and Key B\n  3. Reinterpret the pivot chord in Key B context\n  4. Confirm Key B with a strong cadence (V7 → I in Key B)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-TONAL-HARMONY.md#010",
      "path": [
        "06-TONAL-HARMONY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:music-theory:06-tonal-harmony, git-history:music-theory:06-tonal-harmony]",
