        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Tonal Harmony - Advanced",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "COMMON PIVOT CHORD RELATIONSHIPS:\n  Between keys a fifth apart: many chords in common (5 shared diatonic chords)\n  Between relative keys (same key signature): 5 of 7 chords identical\n  Between parallel keys: only the tonic chord differs by quality (C vs Cm)"
    },
    {
