      "text": "```\nTwo chords that SOUND identical but are spelled differently,\nused to pivot between otherwise distantly related keys:"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-TONAL-HARMONY.md#020",
      "path": [
        "06-TONAL-HARMONY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:music-theory:06-tonal-harmony, git-history:music-theory:06-tonal-harmony]",
        "canonical_path": "music-theory/06-TONAL-HARMONY.md",
