        "root_concepts": "[tonal, harmony]",
        "section": "music-theory",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Tonal Harmony - Advanced",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "DIMINISHED 7TH as pivot (Z₁₂ group theory):\n  Why only 3 distinct dim7 chords? A dim7 = 4 equally-spaced pitch classes\n  (spacing 3 in Z₁₂). The set {0,3,6,9} is a subgroup of order 4.\n  By Lagrange's theorem: 12/4 = 3 cosets = 3 distinct dim7 chords.\n  Same argument: 4 augmented triads (spacing 4, subgroup {0,4,8} order 3, 12/3=4 cosets),\n  6 tritone pairs (spacing 6, 12/2=6), 2 whole-tone scales (spacing 2, 12/6=2).\n  Fully diminished 7th (°7) = four minor thirds stacked\n  Symmetry: only 3 distinct diminished 7th chords (then cycle repeats)\n  Each can be respelled as any of its 4 enharmonic rotations"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-TONAL-HARMONY.md#021",
      "path": [
        "06-TONAL-HARMONY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:music-theory:06-tonal-harmony, git-history:music-theory:06-tonal-harmony]",
        "canonical_path": "music-theory/06-TONAL-HARMONY.md",
        "concepts": "[tonal, harmony]",
        "current_path": "music-theory/06-TONAL-HARMONY.md",
        "id": "maxim:music-theory:tonal-harmony",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "music-theory",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[tonal, harmony]",
        "section": "music-theory",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Tonal Harmony - Advanced",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "B°7 = B–D–F–A♭\n  Respell as D°7 = D–F–A♭–C♭  (C♭ = B enharmonically)\n  Respell as F°7 = F–A♭–C♭–E♭♭ (E♭♭ = D)\n  Respell as A♭°7 = A♭–C♭–E♭♭–G♭♭ (G♭♭ = F)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-TONAL-HARMONY.md#022",
      "path": [
        "06-TONAL-HARMONY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
