        "root_concepts": "[tonal, harmony]",
        "section": "music-theory",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Tonal Harmony - Advanced",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Any °7 chord can resolve to one of four different keys\n  → can modulate from, say, C major to E♭ minor using one °7 pivot chord"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-TONAL-HARMONY.md#023",
      "path": [
        "06-TONAL-HARMONY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
