        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Tonal Harmony - Advanced",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nNEAPOLITAN (N or ♭II): a major triad built on the flattened 2nd scale degree\n  In C major: D♭ major (D♭–F–A♭)\n  In C minor: D♭ major (same)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-TONAL-HARMONY.md#032",
      "path": [
        "06-TONAL-HARMONY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:music-theory:06-tonal-harmony, git-history:music-theory:06-tonal-harmony]",
