        "section": "music-theory",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Tonal Harmony - Advanced",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "WHY \"NEAPOLITAN\": associated with 18th-century Neapolitan opera school\n  Scarlatti, Pergolesi used it; later: Beethoven, Schubert, Chopin, Brahms"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-TONAL-HARMONY.md#035",
      "path": [
        "06-TONAL-HARMONY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
