        "title": "Tonal Harmony - Advanced",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "VOICE LEADING:\n  In N⁶: bass on F, upper voices have D♭ and A♭\n  To V: F stays or moves to G (P5 of V)\n        D♭ → C (half step down, smooth)\n        A♭ → G or B (depending on which part of V)\n  Both D♭ and A♭ want to resolve downward — chromatic pull"
    },
    {
